{"id": "rescale-cfg-core", "name": "RescaleCFG (core, v-pred and flow branches)", "family": "guidance", "subfamily": "rescale", "plain": "Pulls the standard deviation of the guided output back toward that of the positive, counteracting the burn-out from high cfg on zero-terminal-SNR models. Core converts to v-prediction space for \u03b5-style models, and has a separate branch for flow models that works in x0 space.", "math": "Non-flow: v_c, v_u from x\u2212x\u0302 with sigma; v_cfg = v_u + s(v_c\u2212v_u)\nratio = std(v_c)/std(v_cfg) over dims 1,2,3\nv_f = m\u00b7v_cfg\u00b7ratio + (1\u2212m)\u00b7v_cfg; return as x\u2212x\u0302.\nFlow (CONST sampling): same formula on x\u0302_c, x\u0302_u directly, std over all non-batch dims, ro_cfg clamped \u22651e-8.", "props": {"hook": "cfg_function", "extra_model_calls": 0, "params": "multiplier=0.7"}, "evidence": [{"where": "ComfyUI/comfy_extras/nodes_model_advanced.py:276", "symbol": "class RescaleCFG"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy_extras/nodes_model_advanced.py:289", "symbol": "is_flow = isinstance(model_sampling, comfy.model_sampling.CONST)"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy_extras/nodes_model_advanced.py:305", "symbol": "x_0_final = multiplier * x_0_rescaled"}], "providers": [{"pack": "core", "author": "Comfy Org and contributors", "licence": "GPL-3.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["RescaleCFG"], "note": "", "verdict": "", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "comfyanonymous__ComfyUI_experiments", "author": "comfyanonymous", "licence": "GPL", "kind": "variant", "nodes": ["RescaleClassifierFreeGuidanceTest"], "note": "old experiment; see experiments entries", "verdict": "SKIP", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "17Retoucher__ComfyUI_Fooocus", "author": "17Retoucher", "licence": "none-found", "kind": "copy", "nodes": [], "note": "ldm_patched, old form, not diffed", "verdict": "SKIP", "risks": ["installs software at runtime", "runs decoded or dynamic code", "paid or partner API", "patches torch or ComfyUI globally", "downl